Subject: af_unix/scm: fix whitespace errors

From: Alexander Mikhalitsyn <aleksandr.mikhalitsyn@canonical.com>

[ Upstream commit 2b9996417e4ec231c91818f9ea8107ae62ef75ad ]

Fix whitespace/formatting errors.

